eak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にはご飯を食べる会がありまして\n私も参加しました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加メンバーは、\nずー、愛未、かりん、琴子と\n人数は少なかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり全員と話ができて\n普段聞けないような話も聞けて\n凄い楽しかったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きを食べました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋なのに！！\n何故！！\nという感じでしたが\nとっても美味しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと写真撮ればよかったな(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\n明日の全握も楽しみにしてます〜( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとペアです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん初！\n長身コンビ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題よかったら(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・セブンイレブンでよく買うものといえば？\n・オススメの曲は？\n・好きな色は？\n・ぶどう派？マスカット派？\n・ごま油派？オリーブオイル派？\n・黒髪派？茶髪派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん是非教えてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#ChihaOOTD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はファッションというか、\n小物になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}